# Claude pieface archive

> A Claude conversation archive on the Pie Face OS thread.

## Purpose
Explain this repo as a saved conversation shelf about Pie Face, not as the OS itself. Source: fitzyracing1/claude-pieface.

## How it works (plain English)
1. Keep the chat history in this repo.
2. Use it to recall Pie Face talk.
3. Do not treat the archive as the running OS.

## Key ideas
- Conversation archive
- Pie Face thread
- Family of claude-* repos

## The actual code
```
# source: fitzyracing1/claude-pieface
archive = conversation_shelf("pieface")
read(archive)
```

## Line-by-line translation
1. conversation_shelf("pieface") → “this folder holds that thread”
2. read(archive) → “open the saved talk”

## Decisions the program makes
- If a reader wants the OS files → send them to the Pie Face project if it exists
- If a reader wants the chat → stay here

## What a person would notice
A boxed conversation about a lightweight OS idea.

## Current status
Barrage clone.

## Next possible steps
Open the archive.
